# HARROWBY 04 -- Agnes's cottage, which is the alehouse in all but name.
#
# House frame: y = 0 floor, +z the FRONT (door x 0..8, z 29; it swings in
# over x 0..9, z 20..29, so nothing stands there). The plank partition at
# x -16 closes off the back room with the two beds (Agnes, Wat); the front
# room x -14..44 runs to the chimney gable (the fire at x 46, right).
# In the world it is turned 90: the front faces EAST onto the green.
{"cmd": "struct.open", "args": {"ref": "harrowby/alehouse"}}

